# From "Special Tour" (Wave VIII - Union, CD1-1): an overview naming the
# locales the rest of the wave visits in depth (educational-center.gws,
# planning-center.gws, healing-and-regeneration-center.gws,
# coordination-area.gws). A brief pass through each, not the depth the
# dedicated segments give them.

@segment  special-tour
@title    Special Tour of Focus 27
@levels   F27
@duration ~4m

say From your special place, notice whether anything's changed since you were last here. Make whatever modifications suit you now. Invite any guides or helpers you'd like with you.
pause 10
say Now, an overview of the rest of Focus 27 -- places beyond your special place you'll have the chance to explore in depth another time.
pause 6
say Move your intention to the Educational Center. Observe what's around you. Notice the activities taking place.
pause 8
say Now to the Planning Center. Observe. Notice what's happening here.
pause 8
say Now to the Healing and Regeneration Center. Move in, and observe. Let yourself relax here as you take it in.
pause 8
say Now the Coordination Area -- dedicated to maintaining and managing Focus 27 itself. Gather your impressions of the beings and energies at work here.
pause 8
say Now widen your perception further still. Sense areas of Focus 27 related to things beyond the human earth experience entirely -- other systems, unrelated to it. Explore.
hold 60
say Give thanks for all you've seen. Make the intention to remember it.
pause 6
